#: ../../source/viz.rst:2
msgid "Visualization subsystem"
msgstr "可视化子系统"

#: ../../source/viz.rst:4
msgid ""
"``fl-sim`` implements a simple visualization subsystem named ``Panel`` along"
" with a logging system. ``Panel`` is based on Jupyter Widgets (`ipywidgets "
"<https://ipywidgets.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`_), `matplotlib "
"<https://matplotlib.org/>`_ and `seaborn <https://seaborn.pydata.org/>`_. It"
" runs in a Jupyter Notebook or similar environment (Jupyter Lab, Google "
"Colab, Amazon SageMaker, etc.). ``Panel`` has the following features:"
msgstr ""
"``fl-sim`` 实现了一个名为 ``Panel`` 的简单可视化子系统，并配有日志系统。``Panel`` 基于 Jupyter "
"Widgets（`ipywidgets "
"<https://ipywidgets.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`_）、`matplotlib "
"<https://matplotlib.org/>`_ 与 `seaborn <https://seaborn.pydata.org/>`_，可在 "
"Jupyter Notebook 或类似环境（Jupyter Lab、Google Colab、Amazon SageMaker "
"等）中运行。``Panel`` 具有以下功能："

#: ../../source/viz.rst:9
msgid ""
"It automatically searches, lists the log files of completed simulations "
"(numerical experiments) in the specified directory, and displays them in a "
"multi-select list box."
msgstr "自动搜索、列出指定目录中已完成仿真（数值实验）的日志文件，并在多选列表框中展示。"

#: ../../source/viz.rst:10
msgid ""
"It automatically decodes the log files and plots the curves of the specified"
" metrics."
msgstr "自动解码日志文件，绘制指定指标的曲线。"

#: ../../source/viz.rst:11
msgid ""
"It supports interactive operations on the plotted curves, such as zooming, "
"smoothing, font family and size adjustment, etc."
msgstr "支持对所绘曲线的交互操作，如缩放、平滑、字体族与字号调整等。"

#: ../../source/viz.rst:12
msgid ""
"It supports saving the plotted curves to a file in PDF/SVG/PNG/JPEG/PS "
"formats."
msgstr "支持将所绘曲线保存为 PDF/SVG/PNG/JPEG/PS 格式的文件。"

#: ../../source/viz.rst:13
msgid ""
"It supports curve merging via tags into mean-value curves with error bars "
"(optional). The error bounds have 4 options:"
msgstr "支持通过标签将多条曲线合并为带误差棒（可选）的均值曲线。误差范围有 4 种选项："

#: ../../source/viz.rst:15
msgid "standard deviation (STD)"
msgstr "标准差（STD）"

#: ../../source/viz.rst:16
msgid "standard error of the mean (SEM)"
msgstr "平均值的标准误（SEM）"

#: ../../source/viz.rst:17
msgid "quantile (QTL)"
msgstr "分位数（QTL）"

#: ../../source/viz.rst:18
msgid "interquartile range (IQR)"
msgstr "四分位距（IQR）"

